WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:08.260
The first cook book was written by the Greeks
in 400 B.C.

00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:17.180
In Quebec, there is an old law that states
margarine must be a different colour than

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:18.180
butter.

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:22.000
Chewing gum whilst peeling onions will prevent
you from crying.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.340
There are eight different time zones in North
America.

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:34.899
In 1933, the animated, fictional cartoon character
Mickey Mouse received 800,000 fan letters.

00:00:34.899 --> 00:00:39.559
Every 45 seconds, a house catches fire in
the United States.

00:00:39.559 --> 00:00:45.680
Most burglaries happen above the first but
below the seventh floor in a hotel.

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:50.569
If you eat an excessive amount of carrots,
your skin will turn an orange-yellow colour.

00:00:50.569 --> 00:00:57.640
The coldest object in our solar system is
not Pluto, it's Triton, one of Neptune's moons.

00:00:57.640 --> 00:01:01.270
The oldest known goldfish was 41 years old.

00:01:01.270 --> 00:01:06.280
In ancient Egypt, priests plucked every hair
from their bodies, including their eyebrows

00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:08.050
and eyelashes.

00:01:08.050 --> 00:01:13.170
To avoid sinking in quicksand, raise your
legs slowly and lie on your back, this will

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:16.870
distribute your weight evenly and stop you
from sinking.

00:01:16.870 --> 00:01:21.840
The people of Israel consume more turkeys
per capita than any other country.

00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:25.200
Flies jump backwards before they take off.

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:26.390
Roses are red.

00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:30.229
But violets aren't blue, they're violet.

00:01:30.229 --> 00:01:34.539
The clues in the name.

